<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African Aug gold output rises to 41.21 tonnes.</title>
<headline>S.African Aug gold output rises to 41.21 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold output rose in August to 41,208.8 kg from July's 39,979.3, Chamber of Mines figures show.</p>
<p>Detailed figures in kilos (ozs in brackets)-</p>
<p> Aug 1996     Jul 1996     Aug 1995    Jan-Aug 96   Jan-Aug 95</p>
<p> 41,208.8     39,979.3     44,197.1    328,284.7    346,816.5</p>
<p>(1.32 mln)   (1.29 mln)   (1.42 mln)  (10.55 mln)   (11.15 mln)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
